{"2692420":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Idlescape","steam_appid":2692420,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5379350],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlescape is an innovative MMORPG that seamlessly blends idle mechanics with deep RPG elements, offering a unique and engaging gaming experience. Whether you're actively playing or away, your character continues to progress, making it ideal for both casual and hardcore gamers. With development taking over seven years we hope you enjoy our game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Mechanics: Progress continues even when offline, allowing for a flexible playstyle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Skills: Master a variety of skills, including Mining, Foraging, Fishing, Farming, Smithing, Cooking, Crafting, Runecrafting, Enchanting, and Combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and Gathering: Collect resources and craft items to enhance your gameplay.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Combat: Fight a variety of monsters, each with unique challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community Interaction: Join the vibrant community on Discord and Reddit, share tips, and stay updated with the latest news.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Elements<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining: Explore different locations to extract valuable resources.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foraging: Gather herbs and natural materials for crafting.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing: Catch fish for cooking or selling.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming: Cultivate crops and manage your farm for sustainable resources.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smithing: Forge powerful weapons and sturdy armor.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking: Prepare meals to boost your stats and performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting: Create a variety of items to support your adventures.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runecrafting: Craft runes that enhance your abilities and skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanting: Apply magical enhancements to your gear to gain an edge in combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: Engage in strategic battles, gain experience, and collect loot from defeated foes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Updates<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is actively maintained with frequent updates that introduce new features, balance adjustments, and quality-of-life improvements. We have spent seven years working towards a Version 1.0, which will be the full release with updates happening every one to two weeks after launch. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community and Support<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become part of the Idlescape community by joining the official Discord and subreddit. Engage with fellow players, share strategies, and get the latest updates directly from the developers.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlescape is an innovative MMORPG that seamlessly blends idle mechanics with deep RPG elements, offering a unique and engaging gaming experience. Whether you're actively playing or away, your character continues to progress, making it ideal for both casual and hardcore gamers. With development taking over seven years we hope you enjoy our game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Mechanics: Progress continues even when offline, allowing for a flexible playstyle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Skills: Master a variety of skills, including Mining, Foraging, Fishing, Farming, Smithing, Cooking, Crafting, Runecrafting, Enchanting, and Combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and Gathering: Collect resources and craft items to enhance your gameplay.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Combat: Fight a variety of monsters, each with unique challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community Interaction: Join the vibrant community on Discord and Reddit, share tips, and stay updated with the latest news.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Elements<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining: Explore different locations to extract valuable resources.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foraging: Gather herbs and natural materials for crafting.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing: Catch fish for cooking or selling.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming: Cultivate crops and manage your farm for sustainable resources.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smithing: Forge powerful weapons and sturdy armor.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking: Prepare meals to boost your stats and performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting: Create a variety of items to support your adventures.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runecrafting: Craft runes that enhance your abilities and skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanting: Apply magical enhancements to your gear to gain an edge in combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: Engage in strategic battles, gain experience, and collect loot from defeated foes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Updates<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is actively maintained with frequent updates that introduce new features, balance adjustments, and quality-of-life improvements. We have spent seven years working towards a Version 1.0, which will be the full release with updates happening every one to two weeks after launch. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community and Support<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become part of the Idlescape community by joining the official Discord and subreddit. Engage with fellow players, share strategies, and get the latest updates directly from the developers.<\/p>","short_description":"Idlescape is an MMORPG combining idle mechanics with RPG elements. Progress continues offline, allowing mastery of skills like Mining, Fishing, and Combat. Engage in crafting, gathering, and strategic battles. Perfect for casual and hardcore gamers alike.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2692420\/bd6d6206d635ce1be7c0b142ae715e094f40d420\/header.jpg?t=1792710205","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2692420\/0cdd815d6a872119cd6fd3edb3f22a298741f3df\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792710205","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2692420\/0cdd815d6a872119cd6fd3edb3f22a298741f3df\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792710205","website":"https:\/\/idlescape.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Pentium 4 processor or later that's SSE3 capable<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> If you are able to read this, you are good<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong>  macOS Big Sur 11.0.1 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> If you are able to read this, you are good<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> If you can run Steam client you can run this<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Pentium 4 processor or later that's SSE3 capable<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> If you are able to read this, you are good<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"ext_user_account_notice":"Idlescape (Supports Linking to Steam Account)"}}}